5. Send me a message if you are bidding on a large number of games, I may be able to offer free shipping on big purchases.
6. Please be aware that some of these games are big and heavy, leading to higher shipping costs.
7. Transactions will take place via GeekMarket.
8. I accept payment via PayPal Friends &amp; Family or Venmo. Payment details will be sent after calculating final costs.
9. Most games are NIS or used in Like New condition unless otherwise noted. Please reach out if you have questions!
10. This auction will close in the evening on [b][bgcolor=#fffb00]Tuesday, 1/13[/bgcolor][/b].

Thanks, and happy bidding!</description>

	

